{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 589597, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 120170, "uid": 40642, "type": 4, "title": "4.27卡池建议", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1682479417, "updated_at": 1683692838, "updated_uid": 40642, "comment_at": 1683123175, "last_at": 1683199449, "comment_count": 44, "status": 1, "summary": "日服本期暗RAID(国际服下期暗RAID)对策光摩根，技能完全匹配奥拉夫，帮助奥拉夫大量增伤。角色抽取建议和评价不变，正如建议内所说，百分比刀是未来趋势，且操作简单更适合手懒玩家。有没有艳后人偶不影响", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_989/h_1497/202/40642/2023/3/27/368514.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1000/h_6250/202/40642/2023/3/26/210070.png,//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/13/3C/ChpCl12MjCCEQOH5AAAAAJ3C1H8813.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 6, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 20050, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "北京", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 2, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 589597, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"p1\" style=\"\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"p1\" style=\"\">日服本期暗RAID(国际服下期暗RAID)对策光摩根，技能完全匹配奥拉夫，帮助奥拉夫大量增伤。</div>\n<div class=\"p1\" style=\"\">角色抽取建议和评价不变，正如建议内所说，百分比刀是未来趋势，且操作简单更适合手懒玩家。</div>\n<div class=\"p2\" style=\"\">有没有艳后人偶不影响角色的抽取，更需要注意的是奥拉夫只能在<span class=\"s1\" style=\"\">RAID</span>就业。</div></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"989\" data-height=\"1497\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_989/h_1497/202/40642/2023/3/27/368514.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_989/h_1497/202/40642/2023/3/27/368514.jpg\"></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">1.哈托尔·奥拉夫原版实装，没什么意外</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">2.莱码和剪刀WB剧情关联，所以VVA翻牌挪到后面，顺序：莱码RAID-剪刀重做WB-彼列RAID-VVA翻牌</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(237, 8, 8);\">国际服开始日服人偶新增&amp;售卖方式</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">，一个月出4个新人偶，都有指定礼包(直接给1个)售卖，每个都可以买3次。</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">价格：一单，和杀价钻石一样。代冲300+左右</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\">本期新增：<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(237, 8, 8);\">光琴</span>、普巴、内裤、牡丹人偶</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\">4.地狱地铁估计下个月了，策划说好的上半年，拖到6月份是真的牛逼。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\">5.莱码在日服的重做基础上又进行了魔改，改为”暗光琴“（无狂暴）版。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1000\" data-height=\"6250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1000/h_6250/202/40642/2023/3/26/210070.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1000/h_6250/202/40642/2023/3/26/210070.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\">35秒斩车视频</div><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"video-play-wrapper\">\n                      <p class=\"video-title\"></p>\n                      <div class=\"img-video-div\"><img class=\"uploadVideoImg\" src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/1